2026-11-07T12:28:47.9769230Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9828760Z [0m
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9829260Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9829840Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9830120Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9830320Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9830780Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9831070Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9831260Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9831640Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9831850Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9832190Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9832690Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9833100Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9833550Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9833690Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9833840Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9834070Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9834300Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9834650Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9834760Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9834860Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9835000Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9835240Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9835620Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9892380Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9937500Z I will:
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9937800Z 
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9938080Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9939380Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9939790Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9940160Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9940420Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9940660Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9941020Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9941360Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9941740Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9942160Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9997870Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T12:28:47.9999250Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
